---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Rakshata — writer, overthinker, and short-form specialist with a tendency toward 2000-word tangents.">
  <section class="wrap reading-column about-page">
    <h1>About</h1>

    <div class="about-body">
      <p>I'm Rakshata. I write essays, stories, and the occasional cultural autopsy — mostly about books, movies, memes, and whatever else has been rattling around my head.</p>

      <p>A few things worth knowing:</p>

      <ul class="quirk-list">
        <li>I might have a Kafkaesque obsession with the world — though I'm having some second thoughts on that after seeing where the world is headed.</li>
        <li>Writing helps tickle the squishy part of my brain. It also helps me tolerate being a living, breathing human.</li>
        <li>I'm very much interested in the art of selling, but have only ever come close to selling my soul.</li>
        <li>Currently exploring the world of vibe coding.</li>
      </ul>

      <p>Short-form content is my forte — but hey, leave me alone with my laptop long enough and you might end up reading a 2000-word blog about memes, culture, books, movies, and whatnot the next day.</p>

      <p class="about-links">Find me on <a href="https://rakshmulimani.medium.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Medium</a>, <a href="https://rakshata14311.substack.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Substack</a>, and <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/rakshata-mulimani-b79439215/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    padding: 56px 0 96px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .about-body {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 19px;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .about-body p {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .quirk-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }

  .quirk-list li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 28px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .quirk-list li::before {
    content: "—";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .about-links a {
    color: var(--accent);
    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
  }

  .about-links a:hover {
    border-bottom-color: var(--accent);
  }
</style>
